Read mixed-endian ECOFF. In the SDK's libps.a, puts.o and the *SF*.O helpers
have big-endian headers around little-endian code, which is its own BFD target,
so without this any program using them fails to link.

--- a/bfd/config.bfd
+++ b/bfd/config.bfd
@@ -886,7 +886,7 @@
     ;;
   mips*-dec-* | mips*el-*-ecoff*)
     targ_defvec=ecoff_little_vec
-    targ_selvecs=ecoff_big_vec
+    targ_selvecs="ecoff_big_vec ecoff_biglittle_vec"
     ;;
   mips*-*-ecoff*)
     targ_defvec=ecoff_big_vec
